        <mxCell id="L1sYtbS1Cf7boD85PsUE-34" value="&lt;i&gt;ProcessDispatch&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=#9673a6;fillColor=#e1d5e7;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="335" y="730" width="150" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1sYtbS1Cf7boD85PsUE-38" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;i&gt;ProcessDispatch&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/strike&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;translates to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;ProcessRun&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry y="800" width="130" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1sYtbS1Cf7boD85PsUE-40" value="Note: This event is sent only&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;if there is a free core in the&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;processor&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-25" y="630" width="170" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1sYtbS1Cf7boD85PsUE-43" value="Note: The scheduler keeps a&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;reference&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;to the last process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;it dispatched,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;so it can know&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;when to send another process&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-80" y="525" width="170" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1sYtbS1Cf7boD85PsUE-46" value="&lt;i&gt;ProcessRunPaused&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=#9673a6;fillColor=#e1d5e7;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-530" y="615" width="190" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1sYtbS1Cf7boD85PsUE-47" value="Note: This responsibility is currently&lt;div&gt;the scheduler&#39;s, but in the refactor&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;we are giving it to the ProcessManager&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;ProcessManager checks the elapsed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;execution time. If it&#39;s equal to the total&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;runtime, it finishes the process, if not,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;the process is sent to the scheduler&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;again by the ProcessSchedule&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;event&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-540" y="650" width="210" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1sYtbS1Cf7boD85PsUE-62" value="ProcessPreemption" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=#9673a6;fillColor=#e1d5e7;fontStyle=2" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-250" y="645" width="150" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1sYtbS1Cf7boD85PsUE-63" value="Note: This forces the current process&lt;div&gt;to stop executing, sending it to the&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;ProcessManager through the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;ProcessRunPaused event.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;This is regardless of the current state of the&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;processor. A ProcessDispatch event&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;is also sent at the same time to the processor&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-320" y="680" width="240" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1sYtbS1Cf7boD85PsUE-64" value="Note: The allocation can fail, which&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;means that the process &quot;dies&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;before it can be executed, in which case,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;a &quot;ProcessKill&quot; event is issued&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="180" y="230" width="230" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1sYtbS1Cf7boD85PsUE-66" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" edge="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1" source="L1sYtbS1Cf7boD85PsUE-5" target="L1sYtbS1Cf7boD85PsUE-13">
